                         "interpretation":  "The owner\u0027s session-specific allowance permits a longer aggregate investigation; it does not itself implement or qualify a longer native lifetime. All-eligible offload cannot reserve even one hidden prompt token plus an evaluation. First-projection placement avoids that particular all-eligible count but its 600-token operations-only lifetime still cannot admit the ordinary 8192-token context/output contract. The absolute 120-second deadline independently remains. Checkpoint/reset cannot replenish attempted capacity, and failures cannot trigger secret replay.",
