                         "interpretation":  "These are static logical payloads, not measured DRAM traffic, occupancy, time or energy. The 0.348-percent weight share is an indicator of narrow coverage, not a speed bound: projection costs need measurement. HMX\u0027s eight rows are bitplanes of one token, not eight-token prefill. The mapped host cache can avoid repeated CPU packing but leaves kernel weight/result payload unchanged and may increase whole-allocation cache maintenance. No receipt establishes useful complete-answer benefit.",
